OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Ffor most of the Thursday but rain
OL,7,Fspreading east by evening. Dry with
OL,8,Fbright spells on Friday. Rain likely
OL,9,Fon Saturday.
